                                "id": "0,34,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": "You can delete a previously entered operation. Deleting an operation means deleting only the operation symbol while leaving its parameters. This action is performed by pressing [Del] when the cursor is in the \"before operation\" position.",
