                            {
                                "id": "0,68,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": "The editor supports undoing - redoing operations. This means that if you enter incorrectly, you can undo previous actions, and then, if desired, redo previously undone ones. To undo an action, use the [Ctrl+Z] key or the button ",
